@startuml
title Kubernetes lab runtime and separate compatibility-manifest wiring
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #2F5D7C
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4FF
  BorderColor #2F5D7C
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7E7
  BorderColor #D99A22
}

node "kind cluster (disposable lab; not a production dependency)" {
  package "k8gobgp-system: upstream installation" {
    component "BGPConfiguration CRD\nconfigs.bgp.purelb.io" as BGPConfig
    node "k8gobgp DaemonSet pod\none upstream image" {
      component "k8gobgp manager" as Manager
      component "managed gobgpd\nlocal Unix gRPC" as Speaker
    }
  }
  package "Suite-generated Framework / application runtime" {
    component "evpn-node-agent\nshared endpoint services + optional\nNetlink Type-2 reconcilers" as Agent
    component "Multus / evpn-cni\nCNI application only" as CNI
    component "cmd/evpn-ovsdb\nopt-in standalone Type-2 importer" as Importer
  }
  component "OVN/OVS runtime\nNBDB / northd / SBDB /\novn-controller / OVSDB" as OVN
  package "Checked-in compatibility manifest\nnot the accepted suite's speaker connection" as Bundle {
    component "evpn-mgmt\nDeployment / Service :50052" as EvpnMgmt
    component "ovsdb-mgmt\nDeployment / Service :50053" as OvsdbMgmt
    component "bgp_ad_handler\nseparate route-handler Deployment" as Handler
    component "k8gobgp Service\n:50051 -> target :50054" as BGPService
  }
  package "Optional project Operator" {
    component "EvpnCore CRD" as EvpnCore
    component "EvpnCore reconciler\napply-only readiness" as Operator
  }
}
component "External FRR peer\n+ remote workload" as FRR

BGPConfig --> Manager : desired configuration
Manager --> Speaker : reconcile identity / peers / AF / VRFs
Agent --> Speaker : Unix GoBGP gRPC\nType-2 AddPath / UUID DeletePath / ListPath
Importer --> Speaker : Unix GoBGP gRPC ListPath
Speaker <--> FRR : BGP EVPN
CNI --> Agent : local Unix NodeAgentCNI gRPC
Agent --> OVN : shared endpoint services;\nowned Netlink integration observed by controller
Importer --> OVN : direct owned NBDB / OVSDB reconciliation
OVN <--> FRR : OVN/OVS workload VXLAN
EvpnMgmt ..> BGPService : configured TCP client
Handler ..> BGPService : configured TCP route observation
Handler --> OvsdbMgmt : management RPCs
OvsdbMgmt --> OVN : NBDB / OVSDB
EvpnCore --> Operator : reconcile
Operator ..> Bundle : apply core manifest\nalso OVN Deployment / Services

note bottom of BGPService
  Service declaration does not install a proxy or listener.
  No proxy sidecar is assumed in the upstream DaemonSet.
  Accepted suites use managed Unix gRPC directly.
end note
note bottom of Operator
  Does not own upstream BGPConfiguration, CRDs or DaemonSet.
  Image fields are inert; Ready means apply succeeded.
  Future EvpnGateway / EvpnVTEP / EvpnNetwork are not implemented.
end note
note bottom of Importer
  Alternative integration, not the bgp_ad_handler service.
  One network / one remote VTEP accepted; disabled by default.
end note
@enduml
